-Exit status `0` is returned only on a clean shutdown (`SIGINT`/`SIGTERM`).
+Exit status `0` is returned only on a clean shutdown (`SIGINT`/`SIGTERM`), which stops the
+accept loop, closes the listening socket, and returns `0` — verified for both signals.
 
